# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_78364> (vasotocin)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_78364> "A heterodetic cyclic peptide that is homologous to oxytocin and vasopressin. It is a pituitary hormone that acts as an endocrine regulator for water balance, osmotic homoeostasis and is involved in social and sexual behavior in non-mammalian vertebrates.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_78364> "vasotocin")
